
Sovereign Compute — Expanded Technical Specification
============================================================

Sovereign Compute is the execution layer of the DM‑Unit and DM700 architecture.  
It defines how the machine runs, boots, executes tasks, maintains identity, and preserves sovereignty under all conditions.

Memory Physics is the law.  
Memory Architecture is the structure.  
Sovereign Compute is the engine.

